@startuml
title Reports Platform — happy path (as-built): GET /api/v1/apps/{appID}/reports/{report}

actor Partner as U
participant "ReportScreen\n(frontend-flutter/lib/screens/reports)" as Screen
participant "ReportProvider\n(ChangeNotifier)" as Prov
participant "ReportService\n(Dio + Firebase Bearer)" as Svc
participant "Router\n(chi + Firebase/Org MW)" as Router
participant "ReportHandler\n(*_report_handler.go)" as H
participant "app_lookup.go" as Lookup
database "Repos\n(subs / snapshot / txn)" as Repo
participant "Domain services\n(metrics/earnings/fee/risk)" as Dom

U -> Screen : open report / pick date range
Screen -> Prov : load(appId, from, to)
Prov -> Svc : GET reports/{report}?from&to&segment[&format=csv][&limit&offset]
Svc -> Router : HTTPS + Firebase ID token + X-Org-Id
Router -> Router : verify Firebase JWT + resolve Org context
Router -> H : dispatch (appID in path)
H -> Lookup : resolveAppFromRequest(appID)
Lookup -> Repo : FindByID(appID) / partner by org
Repo --> Lookup : app
Lookup --> H : *entity.App
H -> H : parseDateRange(from,to) ; resolveTrendInterval
H -> Repo : FindByAppID(subs) ; FindByAppIDRange(snapshots)
Repo --> H : rows (full dataset)
H -> Dom : aggregate KPIs / trend / fee-verify (over FULL data)
Dom --> H : computed report
H -> H : parsePaging -> pageSlice(rows) [preview 8 / detail <=200]
alt format=csv
  H --> Svc : 200 text/csv (all rows)
else json
  H --> Svc : 200 application/json {kpis, trend, pagedRows}
end
Svc --> Prov : decoded model
Prov -> Screen : notifyListeners()
Screen --> U : KPIs + trend chart + preview table

note over H,Repo
  Error paths (as-built):
  401 no auth · 400 bad appID · 404 app/partner not found
  503 on ANY repo error (no not-found sentinel, ADR-042)
end note
@enduml
